Project Scope Statement
iBelong Self-Service Patient Portal & Intelligent Intake Engine

Background and Business Need
iBelong experiences patient churn aqnd lost revenue led by inefficient intake where a reported 22% appointment no show rate and disjopinted post appointment follow up. Call centers are dealt with major scheduling demand, 
where clinic staff process paper forms and manually resolve questions regardiung insurance and pre authorziation.

This project will involve the creation of a secure patiuent portal that supports digitality, where onboarding, scheduling, patient services, and the ability for identity and insurance verification. Its devlivery scope follow the five epics and 17 issues supplied by the team.

